[size=5][b]⚔ For modders[/b][/size]

The mod exposes a small interface, [font=Courier New]I.H2HWeapons[/font], for asking what kind of hand-to-hand weapon an item is. How everything works - and how to build the plugin, meshes and animations from source - is written up in the [url=https://github.com/MaxYari/Katars-KnucklesOpenMW/blob/main/Sources/DEVELOPMENT.md]technical notes[/url] in the git repository.
